{"id":"487258","name":"炖乌鱼汤","author":"大草海","authorId":"9039782","desc":"","cover":"images/487258/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"乌鱼","amount":"1条"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜","amount":"2片"},{"name":"柠檬皮","amount":"3根"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"1勺"},{"name":"葱","amount":"2根"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"备好食材","img":"images/487258/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加姜柠檬皮葱料酒腌制5分钟","img":"images/487258/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"然后锅里倒油炸一下乌鱼去腥味","img":"images/487258/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"捞出放入砂锅","img":"images/487258/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加葱姜柠檬皮","img":"images/487258/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加开水","img":"images/487258/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"大火烧开中小火熬制1小时以上","img":"images/487258/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"汤汁浓郁成乳白色即可","img":"images/487258/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"装碗。","img":"images/487258/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"乌鱼要中小火慢炖，熬出香味。大概1小时左右。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}